    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.poster.avif?t=1751408677\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.webm?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.mp4?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight to Save Animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle AI robots to rescue adorable animals trapped in dungeons. Each victory brings new furry allies to your side, helping you grow stronger and expand your base to take on even greater threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/fab2d2b5d54bba2ee10a5554f107f4b7.poster.avif?t=1751408677\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/fab2d2b5d54bba2ee10a5554f107f4b7.webm?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/fab2d2b5d54bba2ee10a5554f107f4b7.mp4?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each animal has it's own ability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rescued animal can contribute to enhancing your base. From item transporting sugar gliders to stone collecting hedgehogs, their abilities shape your strategy and improve your crafting efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/214bdd17f8226f1269e4fd0d6db06e6e.poster.avif?t=1751408677\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/214bdd17f8226f1269e4fd0d6db06e6e.webm?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/214bdd17f8226f1269e4fd0d6db06e6e.mp4?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect special skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful skills hidden throughout dungeons. Unleash explosive ranged attacks, wear down enemies with deadly damage over time (DoT), and adapt your strategy with every find. The right skill at the right moment could turn the tide of battle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5407bd0f2f3de33968c82d5449faaf7e.poster.avif?t=1751408677\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5407bd0f2f3de33968c82d5449faaf7e.webm?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5407bd0f2f3de33968c82d5449faaf7e.mp4?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your base for crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically design your crafting system by placing workshops and storage boxes wisely. A well-planned base lets your rescued animals craft powerful weapons and shields faster, helping you gear up quickly to save even more animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5b3883dd638d65fdc84d02ace9280a5d.poster.avif?t=1751408677\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5b3883dd638d65fdc84d02ace9280a5d.webm?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5b3883dd638d65fdc84d02ace9280a5d.mp4?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.poster.avif?t=1751408677\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.webm?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.mp4?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight to Save Animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle AI robots to rescue adorable animals trapped in dungeons. Each victory brings new furry allies to your side, helping you grow stronger and expand your base to take on even greater threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/fab2d2b5d54bba2ee10a5554f107f4b7.poster.avif?t=1751408677\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/fab2d2b5d54bba2ee10a5554f107f4b7.webm?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/fab2d2b5d54bba2ee10a5554f107f4b7.mp4?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each animal has it's own ability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rescued animal can contribute to enhancing your base. From item transporting sugar gliders to stone collecting hedgehogs, their abilities shape your strategy and improve your crafting efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/214bdd17f8226f1269e4fd0d6db06e6e.poster.avif?t=1751408677\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/214bdd17f8226f1269e4fd0d6db06e6e.webm?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/214bdd17f8226f1269e4fd0d6db06e6e.mp4?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect special skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful skills hidden throughout dungeons. Unleash explosive ranged attacks, wear down enemies with deadly damage over time (DoT), and adapt your strategy with every find. The right skill at the right moment could turn the tide of battle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5407bd0f2f3de33968c82d5449faaf7e.poster.avif?t=1751408677\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5407bd0f2f3de33968c82d5449faaf7e.webm?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5407bd0f2f3de33968c82d5449faaf7e.mp4?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your base for crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically design your crafting system by placing workshops and storage boxes wisely. A well-planned base lets your rescued animals craft powerful weapons and shields faster, helping you gear up quickly to save even more animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5b3883dd638d65fdc84d02ace9280a5d.poster.avif?t=1751408677\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5b3883dd638d65fdc84d02ace9280a5d.webm?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/5b3883dd638d65fdc84d02ace9280a5d.mp4?t=1751408677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
